    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a nod to a barista? i dont know. it just feels fake. like i'm performing for people who wouldn't even care if i wasn't there tomorrow. it's exhausting to keep pretending that any of this matters when the silence is so loud. it's like i'm already dead and just haven't realized it yet.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
