    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if i do register in someones periphery, what does that actually change? it doesn't stop the void. it just feels like i'm prolonging something that was already over. if nobody actually sees me, maybe the void is just the reality of things. maybe it's easier to just stop trying to fight it and just... let go.",
